              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Because I did not have vine-riped tomatoes, I used half a pint of halved cherry tomatoes. This is wonderful--simple and delicious. Honestly, I ate the whole bowl by myself! No guilt here......it's low carb and low in calories."
          },
          {
