              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kilyena"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made this salad many times but never used balsamic vinegar had always used red wine vinegar or just regular white vinegar. I love the taste the balsamic vinegar gives this salad. I added half a red onion and used cherry tomatoes cut in half. It was a wonderful side dish. Will make again and again. Thanks for sharing.",
